        "citations": null,
        "text": "B) Stay in my real life\n\nReal relationships and real accomplishments matter to me in a way a simulation can't fully replicate, even one I'd never know was simulated. The people I love would be left behind, and I'd be trading away the truth of my life for a comfort that is, at bottom, a fiction I'd have chosen without knowing it.",
